import outlines.dl
import animation.dl
import tabs.dl

to draw document UI tabs {a pointer to UI layout:layout} in {UI bounds:box} in {a pointer to UI view:view} on {UI frame:frame}:
    set selected to the selected tab of (layout's node) in (view's instance)
    set child to layout's first
    loop while child != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout):
        set header to child's tab bounds
        set header's x to header's x + box's x
        set header's y to header's y + box's y
        increment view's paint serial
        set child's paint serial to view's paint serial
        set child's painted bounds to header
        set child's hit bounds to the UI intersection of header and (view's hit bounds)
        set child's paint generation to view's paint count
        set active to child's node = selected
        set target to 1.0 if (view's hot = child), else 0.0
        set child's hover to UI value (child's hover) approaching target at speed 14.0 in view
        set ink to layout's appearance's foreground
        draw a rounded UI surface header with radius (layout's appearance's radius) from ink to ink opacity ((child's hover * 20.0) as an integer) feathered by 0.75 on frame
        if active:
            draw a rounded UI box (UI box at (header's x) ((header's y + header's height) - 2.0) sized (header's width) 2.0) with radius 1.0 in ink on frame
        if (view's focused = child) and (view's keyboard focus):
            draw a rounded UI outline header with radius (layout's appearance's radius) width 1.0 in ink on frame
        set view's selectable to false
        set label to (the UI value for (child's node) in (view's instance))'s text
        draw UI text label at (header's x + (header's width - (the width of label using (layout's typeface))) / 2.0) (header's y + (header's height - layout's typeface's size) / 2.0 + layout's typeface's size * 0.8) with (layout's typeface) in ink on frame
        set view's selectable to true
        set child to child's next
    set child to layout's first
    loop while child's node != selected:
        set child to child's next
    set panel to child
    set child to panel's first
    loop while child != @intrinsic("construct", a pointer to UI layout):
        draw document UI layout child at (box's x + panel's bounds' x) (box's y + panel's bounds' y) in view on frame
        set child to child's next
